        "titulo": "The most important irregular verbs",
        "explicacao": "The most important irregular verbs. A few verbs do not follow the rule. Here are the main ones. БЫТЬ (to be): the most important. This is the verb you use when you want to say \"I was at home\" (Я был до́ма / Я была́ до́ма). ИДТИ (to go on foot): the most famous of the irregulars. Attention: the verb идти becomes шёл in the past. The stem is completely different, a linguistic fossil. Memorise it. МОЧЬ (can, to be able): мог, могла́, могло́, могли́. ЕСТЬ (to eat): ел, е́ла, е́ло, е́ли. ПИТЬ (to drink): пил, пила́, пи́ло, пи́ли. (English irregular verbs, like \"go / went\" and \"eat / ate\", are the same kind of fossil.)",
